{"bookId":"malachi","version":"kjv-strong","source":"eBible KJV2006 USFM","chapters":{"1":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"The burden of the word of the LORD to Israel by Malachi.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"burden","strongs":["H4853"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"word","strongs":["H1697"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"Israel","strongs":["H3478"]},{"text":"by","strongs":["H3027"]},{"text":"Malachi","strongs":["H4401"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":2,"text":"I have loved you, saith the LORD. Yet ye say, Wherein hast thou loved us? Was not Esau Jacob’s brother? saith the LORD: yet I loved Jacob,","tokens":[{"text":"I have"},{"text":"loved","strongs":["H0157"]},{"text":"you,"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H5002"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":". Yet ye"},{"text":"say","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", Wherein hast thou"},{"text":"loved","strongs":["H0157"]},{"text":"us? Was not"},{"text":"Esau","strongs":["H6215"]},{"text":"Jacob’s","strongs":["H3290"]},{"text":"brother","strongs":["H0251"]},{"text":"?"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":": yet I"},{"text":"loved","strongs":["H0157"]},{"text":"Jacob","strongs":["H3290"]},{"text":","}]},{"number":3,"text":"And I hated Esau, and laid his mountains and his heritage waste for the dragons of the wilderness.","tokens":[{"text":"And I"},{"text":"hated","strongs":["H8130"]},{"text":"Esau","strongs":["H6215"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"laid","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"mountains","strongs":["H2022"]},{"text":"and his"},{"text":"heritage","strongs":["H5159"]},{"text":"waste","strongs":["H8077"]},{"text":"for the"},{"text":"dragons","strongs":["H8568"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"wilderness","strongs":["H4057"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":4,"text":"Whereas Edom saith, We are impoverished, but we will return and build the desolate places; thus saith the LORD of hosts, They shall build, but I will throw down; and they shall call them, The border of wickedness, and, The people against whom the LORD hath indignation for ever.","tokens":[{"text":"Whereas"},{"text":"Edom","strongs":["H0123"]},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", We are"},{"text":"impoverished","strongs":["H7567"]},{"text":", but we will"},{"text":"return","strongs":["H7725"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"build","strongs":["H1129"]},{"text":"the desolate"},{"text":"places","strongs":["H2723"]},{"text":"; thus"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":", They shall"},{"text":"build","strongs":["H1129"]},{"text":", but I will throw"},{"text":"down","strongs":["H2040"]},{"text":"; and they shall"},{"text":"call","strongs":["H7121"]},{"text":"them, The"},{"text":"border","strongs":["H1366"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"wickedness","strongs":["H7564"]},{"text":", and, The"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":"against whom the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"hath"},{"text":"indignation","strongs":["H2194"]},{"text":"for","strongs":["H5704"]},{"text":"ever","strongs":["H5769"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":5,"text":"And your eyes shall see, and ye shall say, The LORD will be magnified from the border of Israel.","tokens":[{"text":"And your"},{"text":"eyes","strongs":["H5869"]},{"text":"shall"},{"text":"see","strongs":["H7200"]},{"text":", and ye shall"},{"text":"say","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", The"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"will be"},{"text":"magnified","strongs":["H1431"]},{"text":"from the"},{"text":"border","strongs":["H1366"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Israel","strongs":["H3478"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":6,"text":"A son honoureth his father, and a servant his master: if then I be a father, where is mine honour? and if I be a master, where is my fear? saith the LORD of hosts unto you, O priests, that despise my name. And ye say, Wherein have we despised thy name?","tokens":[{"text":"A"},{"text":"son","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":"honoureth","strongs":["H3513"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"father","strongs":["H0001"]},{"text":", and a"},{"text":"servant","strongs":["H5650"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"master","strongs":["H0113"]},{"text":": if then I be a"},{"text":"father","strongs":["H0001"]},{"text":", where is mine"},{"text":"honour","strongs":["H3519"]},{"text":"? and if I be a"},{"text":"master","strongs":["H0113"]},{"text":", where is my"},{"text":"fear","strongs":["H4172"]},{"text":"?"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"unto you, O"},{"text":"priests","strongs":["H3548"]},{"text":", that"},{"text":"despise","strongs":["H0959"]},{"text":"my"},{"text":"name","strongs":["H8034"]},{"text":". And ye"},{"text":"say","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", Wherein have we"},{"text":"despised","strongs":["H0959"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"name","strongs":["H8034"]},{"text":"?"}]},{"number":7,"text":"Ye offer polluted bread upon mine altar; and ye say, Wherein have we polluted thee? In that ye say, The table of the LORD is contemptible.","tokens":[{"text":"Ye"},{"text":"offer","strongs":["H5066"]},{"text":"polluted","strongs":["H1351"]},{"text":"bread","strongs":["H3899"]},{"text":"upon mine"},{"text":"altar","strongs":["H4196"]},{"text":"; and ye"},{"text":"say","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", Wherein have we"},{"text":"polluted","strongs":["H1351"]},{"text":"thee? In that ye"},{"text":"say","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", The"},{"text":"table","strongs":["H7979"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"contemptible","strongs":["H0959"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":8,"text":"And if ye offer the blind for sacrifice, is it not evil? and if ye offer the lame and sick, is it not evil? offer it now unto thy governor; will he be pleased with thee, or accept thy person? saith the LORD of hosts.","tokens":[{"text":"And if ye"},{"text":"offer","strongs":["H5066"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"blind","strongs":["H5787"]},{"text":"for"},{"text":"sacrifice","strongs":["H2076"]},{"text":", is it not"},{"text":"evil","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":"? and if ye"},{"text":"offer","strongs":["H5066"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"lame","strongs":["H6455"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"sick","strongs":["H2470"]},{"text":", is it not"},{"text":"evil","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":"?"},{"text":"offer","strongs":["H7126"]},{"text":"it now unto thy"},{"text":"governor","strongs":["H6346"]},{"text":"; will he be"},{"text":"pleased","strongs":["H7521"]},{"text":"with thee, or"},{"text":"accept","strongs":["H5375"]},{"text":"thy"},{"text":"person","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"?"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":9,"text":"And now, I pray you, beseech God that he will be gracious unto us: this hath been by your means: will he regard your persons? saith the LORD of hosts.","tokens":[{"text":"And now, I pray you,"},{"text":"beseech","strongs":["H2470"]},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0410"]},{"text":"that he will be"},{"text":"gracious","strongs":["H2603"]},{"text":"unto us: this hath been by your"},{"text":"means","strongs":["H3027"]},{"text":": will he"},{"text":"regard","strongs":["H5375"]},{"text":"your"},{"text":"persons","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"?"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":10,"text":"Who is there even among you that would shut the doors for nought? neither do ye kindle fire on mine altar for nought. I have no pleasure in you, saith the LORD of hosts, neither will I accept an offering at your hand.","tokens":[{"text":"Who is there even among you that would"},{"text":"shut","strongs":["H5462"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"doors","strongs":["H1817"]},{"text":"for nought? neither do ye"},{"text":"kindle","strongs":["H0215"]},{"text":"fire on mine"},{"text":"altar","strongs":["H4196"]},{"text":"for"},{"text":"nought","strongs":["H2600"]},{"text":". I have no"},{"text":"pleasure","strongs":["H2656"]},{"text":"in you,"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":", neither will I"},{"text":"accept","strongs":["H7521"]},{"text":"an"},{"text":"offering","strongs":["H4503"]},{"text":"at your"},{"text":"hand","strongs":["H3027"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":11,"text":"For from the rising of the sun even unto the going down of the same my name shall be great among the Gentiles; and in every place incense shall be offered unto my name, and a pure offering: for my name shall be great among the heathen, saith the LORD of hosts.","tokens":[{"text":"For from the"},{"text":"rising","strongs":["H4217"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"sun","strongs":["H8121"]},{"text":"even unto the going"},{"text":"down","strongs":["H3996"]},{"text":"of the same my"},{"text":"name","strongs":["H8034"]},{"text":"shall be"},{"text":"great","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"among the"},{"text":"Gentiles","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":"; and in every"},{"text":"place","strongs":["H4725"]},{"text":"incense","strongs":["H6999"]},{"text":"shall be"},{"text":"offered","strongs":["H5066"]},{"text":"unto my"},{"text":"name","strongs":["H8034"]},{"text":", and a"},{"text":"pure","strongs":["H2889"]},{"text":"offering","strongs":["H4503"]},{"text":": for my"},{"text":"name","strongs":["H8034"]},{"text":"shall be"},{"text":"great","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"among the"},{"text":"heathen","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":12,"text":"But ye have profaned it, in that ye say, The table of the LORD is polluted; and the fruit thereof, even his meat, is contemptible.","tokens":[{"text":"But ye have"},{"text":"profaned","strongs":["H2490"]},{"text":"it, in that ye"},{"text":"say","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", The"},{"text":"table","strongs":["H7979"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"polluted","strongs":["H1351"]},{"text":"; and the"},{"text":"fruit","strongs":["H5108"]},{"text":"thereof, even his"},{"text":"meat","strongs":["H0400"]},{"text":", is"},{"text":"contemptible","strongs":["H0959"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":13,"text":"Ye said also, Behold, what a weariness is it! and ye have snuffed at it, saith the LORD of hosts; and ye brought that which was torn, and the lame, and the sick; thus ye brought an offering: should I accept this of your hand? saith the LORD.","tokens":[{"text":"Ye"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"also, Behold, what a"},{"text":"weariness","strongs":["H4972"]},{"text":"is it! and ye have"},{"text":"snuffed","strongs":["H5301"]},{"text":"at it,"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"; and ye"},{"text":"brought","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"that which was"},{"text":"torn","strongs":["H1497"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"lame","strongs":["H6455"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"sick","strongs":["H2470"]},{"text":"; thus ye"},{"text":"brought","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"an"},{"text":"offering","strongs":["H4503"]},{"text":": should I"},{"text":"accept","strongs":["H7521"]},{"text":"this of your"},{"text":"hand","strongs":["H3027"]},{"text":"?"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":14,"text":"But cursed be the deceiver, which hath in his flock a male, and voweth, and sacrificeth unto the Lord a corrupt thing: for I am a great King, saith the LORD of hosts, and my name is dreadful among the heathen.","tokens":[{"text":"But"},{"text":"cursed","strongs":["H0779"]},{"text":"be the"},{"text":"deceiver","strongs":["H5230"]},{"text":","},{"text":"which","strongs":["H3426"]},{"text":"hath in his"},{"text":"flock","strongs":["H5739"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"male","strongs":["H2145"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"voweth","strongs":["H5087"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"sacrificeth","strongs":["H2076"]},{"text":"unto the"},{"text":"Lord","strongs":["H0136"]},{"text":"a corrupt"},{"text":"thing","strongs":["H7843"]},{"text":": for I am a"},{"text":"great","strongs":["H1419"]},{"text":"King","strongs":["H4428"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":", and my"},{"text":"name","strongs":["H8034"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"dreadful","strongs":["H3372"]},{"text":"among the"},{"text":"heathen","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":"."}]}]},"2":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"And now, O ye priests, this commandment is for you.","tokens":[{"text":"And now, O ye"},{"text":"priests","strongs":["H3548"]},{"text":", this"},{"text":"commandment","strongs":["H4687"]},{"text":"is for you."}]},{"number":2,"text":"If ye will not hear, and if ye will not lay it to heart, to give glory unto my name, saith the LORD of hosts, I will even send a curse upon you, and I will curse your blessings: yea, I have cursed them already, because ye do not lay it to heart.","tokens":[{"text":"If ye will not"},{"text":"hear","strongs":["H8085"]},{"text":", and if ye will not"},{"text":"lay","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"it to"},{"text":"heart","strongs":["H3820"]},{"text":", to"},{"text":"give","strongs":["H5414"]},{"text":"glory","strongs":["H3519"]},{"text":"unto my"},{"text":"name","strongs":["H8034"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":", I will even"},{"text":"send","strongs":["H7971"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"curse","strongs":["H3994"]},{"text":"upon you, and I will"},{"text":"curse","strongs":["H0779"]},{"text":"your"},{"text":"blessings","strongs":["H1293"]},{"text":": yea, I have"},{"text":"cursed","strongs":["H0779"]},{"text":"them already, because ye do not"},{"text":"lay","strongs":["H7760"]},{"text":"it to"},{"text":"heart","strongs":["H3820"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":3,"text":"Behold, I will corrupt your seed, and spread dung upon your faces, even the dung of your solemn feasts; and one shall take you away with it.","tokens":[{"text":"Behold, I will"},{"text":"corrupt","strongs":["H1605"]},{"text":"your"},{"text":"seed","strongs":["H2233"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"spread","strongs":["H2219"]},{"text":"dung","strongs":["H6569"]},{"text":"upon your"},{"text":"faces","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":", even the"},{"text":"dung","strongs":["H6569"]},{"text":"of your solemn"},{"text":"feasts","strongs":["H2282"]},{"text":"; and one shall take you"},{"text":"away","strongs":["H5375"]},{"text":"with it."}]},{"number":4,"text":"And ye shall know that I have sent this commandment unto you, that my covenant might be with Levi, saith the LORD of hosts.","tokens":[{"text":"And ye shall"},{"text":"know","strongs":["H3045"]},{"text":"that I have"},{"text":"sent","strongs":["H7971"]},{"text":"this"},{"text":"commandment","strongs":["H4687"]},{"text":"unto you, that my"},{"text":"covenant","strongs":["H1285"]},{"text":"might be with"},{"text":"Levi","strongs":["H3878"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":5,"text":"My covenant was with him of life and peace; and I gave them to him for the fear wherewith he feared me, and was afraid before my name.","tokens":[{"text":"My"},{"text":"covenant","strongs":["H1285"]},{"text":"was with him of"},{"text":"life","strongs":["H2416"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"peace","strongs":["H7965"]},{"text":"; and I"},{"text":"gave","strongs":["H5414"]},{"text":"them to him for the"},{"text":"fear","strongs":["H4172"]},{"text":"wherewith he"},{"text":"feared","strongs":["H3372"]},{"text":"me, and was"},{"text":"afraid","strongs":["H2865"]},{"text":"before","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"my"},{"text":"name","strongs":["H8034"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":6,"text":"The law of truth was in his mouth, and iniquity was not found in his lips: he walked with me in peace and equity, and did turn many away from iniquity.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"law","strongs":["H8451"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"truth","strongs":["H0571"]},{"text":"was in his"},{"text":"mouth","strongs":["H6310"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"iniquity","strongs":["H5766"]},{"text":"was not"},{"text":"found","strongs":["H4672"]},{"text":"in his"},{"text":"lips","strongs":["H8193"]},{"text":": he"},{"text":"walked","strongs":["H1980"]},{"text":"with me in"},{"text":"peace","strongs":["H7965"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"equity","strongs":["H4334"]},{"text":", and did"},{"text":"turn","strongs":["H7725"]},{"text":"many","strongs":["H7227"]},{"text":"away","strongs":["H7725"]},{"text":"from"},{"text":"iniquity","strongs":["H5771"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":7,"text":"For the priest’s lips should keep knowledge, and they should seek the law at his mouth: for he is the messenger of the LORD of hosts.","tokens":[{"text":"For the"},{"text":"priest’s","strongs":["H3548"]},{"text":"lips","strongs":["H8193"]},{"text":"should"},{"text":"keep","strongs":["H8104"]},{"text":"knowledge","strongs":["H1847"]},{"text":", and they should"},{"text":"seek","strongs":["H1245"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"law","strongs":["H8451"]},{"text":"at his"},{"text":"mouth","strongs":["H6310"]},{"text":": for he is the"},{"text":"messenger","strongs":["H4397"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":8,"text":"But ye are departed out of the way; ye have caused many to stumble at the law; ye have corrupted the covenant of Levi, saith the LORD of hosts.","tokens":[{"text":"But ye are"},{"text":"departed","strongs":["H5493"]},{"text":"out of the"},{"text":"way","strongs":["H1870"]},{"text":"; ye have caused"},{"text":"many","strongs":["H7227"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"stumble","strongs":["H3782"]},{"text":"at the"},{"text":"law","strongs":["H8451"]},{"text":"; ye have"},{"text":"corrupted","strongs":["H7843"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"covenant","strongs":["H1285"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Levi","strongs":["H3878"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":9,"text":"Therefore have I also made you contemptible and base before all the people, according as ye have not kept my ways, but have been partial in the law.","tokens":[{"text":"Therefore have I also"},{"text":"made","strongs":["H5414"]},{"text":"you"},{"text":"contemptible","strongs":["H0959"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"base","strongs":["H8217"]},{"text":"before all the"},{"text":"people","strongs":["H5971"]},{"text":","},{"text":"according","strongs":["H6310"]},{"text":"as ye have not"},{"text":"kept","strongs":["H8104"]},{"text":"my"},{"text":"ways","strongs":["H1870"]},{"text":", but have been"},{"text":"partial","strongs":["H5375"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"law","strongs":["H8451"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":10,"text":"Have we not all one father? hath not one God created us? why do we deal treacherously every man against his brother, by profaning the covenant of our fathers?","tokens":[{"text":"Have we not all"},{"text":"one","strongs":["H0259"]},{"text":"father","strongs":["H0001"]},{"text":"? hath not"},{"text":"one","strongs":["H0259"]},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0410"]},{"text":"created","strongs":["H1254"]},{"text":"us? why do we deal"},{"text":"treacherously","strongs":["H0898"]},{"text":"every"},{"text":"man","strongs":["H0376"]},{"text":"against his"},{"text":"brother","strongs":["H0251"]},{"text":", by"},{"text":"profaning","strongs":["H2490"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"covenant","strongs":["H1285"]},{"text":"of our"},{"text":"fathers","strongs":["H0001"]},{"text":"?"}]},{"number":11,"text":"Judah hath dealt treacherously, and an abomination is committed in Israel and in Jerusalem; for Judah hath profaned the holiness of the LORD which he loved, and hath married the daughter of a strange god.","tokens":[{"text":"Judah","strongs":["H3063"]},{"text":"hath dealt"},{"text":"treacherously","strongs":["H0898"]},{"text":", and an"},{"text":"abomination","strongs":["H8441"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"committed","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"in"},{"text":"Israel","strongs":["H3478"]},{"text":"and in"},{"text":"Jerusalem","strongs":["H3389"]},{"text":"; for"},{"text":"Judah","strongs":["H3063"]},{"text":"hath"},{"text":"profaned","strongs":["H2490"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"holiness","strongs":["H6944"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"which he"},{"text":"loved","strongs":["H0157"]},{"text":", and hath"},{"text":"married","strongs":["H1166"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"daughter","strongs":["H1323"]},{"text":"of a"},{"text":"strange","strongs":["H5236"]},{"text":"god","strongs":["H0410"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":12,"text":"The LORD will cut off the man that doeth this, the master and the scholar, out of the tabernacles of Jacob, and him that offereth an offering unto the LORD of hosts.","tokens":[{"text":"The"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"will cut"},{"text":"off","strongs":["H3772"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"man","strongs":["H0376"]},{"text":"that"},{"text":"doeth","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"this, the"},{"text":"master","strongs":["H5782"]},{"text":"and the"},{"text":"scholar","strongs":["H6030"]},{"text":", out of the"},{"text":"tabernacles","strongs":["H0168"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Jacob","strongs":["H3290"]},{"text":", and him that"},{"text":"offereth","strongs":["H5066"]},{"text":"an"},{"text":"offering","strongs":["H4503"]},{"text":"unto the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":13,"text":"And this have ye done again, covering the altar of the LORD with tears, with weeping, and with crying out, insomuch that he regardeth not the offering any more, or receiveth it with good will at your hand.","tokens":[{"text":"And this have ye"},{"text":"done","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"again","strongs":["H8145"]},{"text":","},{"text":"covering","strongs":["H3680"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"altar","strongs":["H4196"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"with"},{"text":"tears","strongs":["H1832"]},{"text":", with"},{"text":"weeping","strongs":["H1065"]},{"text":", and with crying"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H0603"]},{"text":", insomuch that he"},{"text":"regardeth","strongs":["H6437"]},{"text":"not the"},{"text":"offering","strongs":["H4503"]},{"text":"any more, or"},{"text":"receiveth","strongs":["H3947"]},{"text":"it with good"},{"text":"will","strongs":["H7522"]},{"text":"at your"},{"text":"hand","strongs":["H3027"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":14,"text":"Yet ye say, Wherefore? Because the LORD hath been witness between thee and the wife of thy youth, against whom thou hast dealt treacherously: yet is she thy companion, and the wife of thy covenant.","tokens":[{"text":"Yet ye"},{"text":"say","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":","},{"text":"Wherefore","strongs":["H4100"]},{"text":"? Because the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"hath been"},{"text":"witness","strongs":["H5749"]},{"text":"between thee and the"},{"text":"wife","strongs":["H0802"]},{"text":"of thy"},{"text":"youth","strongs":["H5271"]},{"text":", against whom thou hast dealt"},{"text":"treacherously","strongs":["H0898"]},{"text":": yet is she thy"},{"text":"companion","strongs":["H2278"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"wife","strongs":["H0802"]},{"text":"of thy"},{"text":"covenant","strongs":["H1285"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":15,"text":"And did not he make one? Yet had he the residue of the spirit. And wherefore one? That he might seek a godly seed. Therefore take heed to your spirit, and let none deal treacherously against the wife of his youth.","tokens":[{"text":"And did not he"},{"text":"make","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"one","strongs":["H0259"]},{"text":"? Yet had he the"},{"text":"residue","strongs":["H7605"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"spirit","strongs":["H7307"]},{"text":". And wherefore"},{"text":"one","strongs":["H0259"]},{"text":"? That he might"},{"text":"seek","strongs":["H1245"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"godly","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"seed","strongs":["H2233"]},{"text":". Therefore take"},{"text":"heed","strongs":["H8104"]},{"text":"to your"},{"text":"spirit","strongs":["H7307"]},{"text":", and let none deal"},{"text":"treacherously","strongs":["H0898"]},{"text":"against the"},{"text":"wife","strongs":["H0802"]},{"text":"of his"},{"text":"youth","strongs":["H5271"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":16,"text":"For the LORD, the God of Israel, saith that he hateth putting away: for one covereth violence with his garment, saith the LORD of hosts: therefore take heed to your spirit, that ye deal not treacherously.","tokens":[{"text":"For the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", the"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Israel","strongs":["H3478"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"that he"},{"text":"hateth","strongs":["H8130"]},{"text":"putting"},{"text":"away","strongs":["H7971"]},{"text":": for one"},{"text":"covereth","strongs":["H3680"]},{"text":"violence","strongs":["H2555"]},{"text":"with his"},{"text":"garment","strongs":["H3830"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":": therefore take"},{"text":"heed","strongs":["H8104"]},{"text":"to your"},{"text":"spirit","strongs":["H7307"]},{"text":", that ye deal not"},{"text":"treacherously","strongs":["H0898"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":17,"text":"Ye have wearied the LORD with your words. Yet ye say, Wherein have we wearied him? When ye say, Every one that doeth evil is good in the sight of the LORD, and he delighteth in them; or, Where is the God of judgment?","tokens":[{"text":"Ye have"},{"text":"wearied","strongs":["H3021"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"with your"},{"text":"words","strongs":["H1697"]},{"text":". Yet ye"},{"text":"say","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", Wherein have we"},{"text":"wearied","strongs":["H3021"]},{"text":"him? When ye"},{"text":"say","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", Every one that"},{"text":"doeth","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"evil","strongs":["H7451"]},{"text":"is"},{"text":"good","strongs":["H2896"]},{"text":"in the"},{"text":"sight","strongs":["H5869"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", and he"},{"text":"delighteth","strongs":["H2654"]},{"text":"in them; or, Where is the"},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"judgment","strongs":["H4941"]},{"text":"?"}]}]},"3":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Behold, I will send my messenger, and he shall prepare the way before me: and the Lord, whom ye seek, shall suddenly come to his temple, even the messenger of the covenant, whom ye delight in: behold, he shall come, saith the LORD of hosts.","tokens":[{"text":"Behold, I will"},{"text":"send","strongs":["H7971"]},{"text":"my"},{"text":"messenger","strongs":["H4397"]},{"text":", and he shall"},{"text":"prepare","strongs":["H6437"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"way","strongs":["H1870"]},{"text":"before","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"me: and the"},{"text":"Lord","strongs":["H0113"]},{"text":", whom ye"},{"text":"seek","strongs":["H1245"]},{"text":", shall"},{"text":"suddenly","strongs":["H6597"]},{"text":"come","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"to his"},{"text":"temple","strongs":["H1964"]},{"text":", even the"},{"text":"messenger","strongs":["H4397"]},{"text":"of the"},{"text":"covenant","strongs":["H1285"]},{"text":", whom ye"},{"text":"delight","strongs":["H2655"]},{"text":"in: behold, he shall"},{"text":"come","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":2,"text":"But who may abide the day of his coming? and who shall stand when he appeareth? for he is like a refiner’s fire, and like fullers’ soap:","tokens":[{"text":"But who may"},{"text":"abide","strongs":["H3557"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of his"},{"text":"coming","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"? and who shall"},{"text":"stand","strongs":["H5975"]},{"text":"when he"},{"text":"appeareth","strongs":["H7200"]},{"text":"? for he is like a"},{"text":"refiner’s","strongs":["H6884"]},{"text":"fire","strongs":["H0784"]},{"text":", and like"},{"text":"fullers’","strongs":["H3526"]},{"text":"soap","strongs":["H1287"]},{"text":":"}]},{"number":3,"text":"And he shall sit as a refiner and purifier of silver: and he shall purify the sons of Levi, and purge them as gold and silver, that they may offer unto the LORD an offering in righteousness.","tokens":[{"text":"And he shall"},{"text":"sit","strongs":["H3427"]},{"text":"as a"},{"text":"refiner","strongs":["H6884"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"purifier","strongs":["H2891"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"silver","strongs":["H3701"]},{"text":": and he shall"},{"text":"purify","strongs":["H2891"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"sons","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Levi","strongs":["H3878"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"purge","strongs":["H2212"]},{"text":"them as"},{"text":"gold","strongs":["H2091"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"silver","strongs":["H3701"]},{"text":", that they may"},{"text":"offer","strongs":["H5066"]},{"text":"unto the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"an"},{"text":"offering","strongs":["H4503"]},{"text":"in"},{"text":"righteousness","strongs":["H6666"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":4,"text":"Then shall the offering of Judah and Jerusalem be pleasant unto the LORD, as in the days of old, and as in former years.","tokens":[{"text":"Then shall the"},{"text":"offering","strongs":["H4503"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Judah","strongs":["H3063"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"Jerusalem","strongs":["H3389"]},{"text":"be"},{"text":"pleasant","strongs":["H6149"]},{"text":"unto the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", as in the"},{"text":"days","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"old","strongs":["H5769"]},{"text":", and as in"},{"text":"former","strongs":["H6931"]},{"text":"years","strongs":["H8141"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":5,"text":"And I will come near to you to judgment; and I will be a swift witness against the sorcerers, and against the adulterers, and against false swearers, and against those that oppress the hireling in his wages, the widow, and the fatherless, and that turn aside the stranger from his right, and fear not me, saith the LORD of hosts.","tokens":[{"text":"And I will come"},{"text":"near","strongs":["H7126"]},{"text":"to you to"},{"text":"judgment","strongs":["H4941"]},{"text":"; and I will be a"},{"text":"swift","strongs":["H4116"]},{"text":"witness","strongs":["H5707"]},{"text":"against the"},{"text":"sorcerers","strongs":["H3784"]},{"text":", and against the"},{"text":"adulterers","strongs":["H5003"]},{"text":", and against"},{"text":"false","strongs":["H8267"]},{"text":"swearers","strongs":["H7650"]},{"text":", and against those that"},{"text":"oppress","strongs":["H6231"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"hireling","strongs":["H7916"]},{"text":"in his"},{"text":"wages","strongs":["H7939"]},{"text":", the"},{"text":"widow","strongs":["H0490"]},{"text":", and the"},{"text":"fatherless","strongs":["H3490"]},{"text":", and that turn"},{"text":"aside","strongs":["H5186"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"stranger","strongs":["H1616"]},{"text":"from his right, and"},{"text":"fear","strongs":["H3372"]},{"text":"not me,"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":6,"text":"For I am the LORD, I change not; therefore ye sons of Jacob are not consumed.","tokens":[{"text":"For I am the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", I"},{"text":"change","strongs":["H8138"]},{"text":"not; therefore ye"},{"text":"sons","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"Jacob","strongs":["H3290"]},{"text":"are not"},{"text":"consumed","strongs":["H3615"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":7,"text":"Even from the days of your fathers ye are gone away from mine ordinances, and have not kept them. Return unto me, and I will return unto you, saith the LORD of hosts. But ye said, Wherein shall we return?","tokens":[{"text":"Even from the"},{"text":"days","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"of your"},{"text":"fathers","strongs":["H0001"]},{"text":"ye are gone"},{"text":"away","strongs":["H5493"]},{"text":"from mine"},{"text":"ordinances","strongs":["H2706"]},{"text":", and have not"},{"text":"kept","strongs":["H8104"]},{"text":"them."},{"text":"Return","strongs":["H7725"]},{"text":"unto me, and I will"},{"text":"return","strongs":["H7725"]},{"text":"unto you,"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":". But ye"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", Wherein shall we"},{"text":"return","strongs":["H7725"]},{"text":"?"}]},{"number":8,"text":"Will a man rob God? Yet ye have robbed me. But ye say, Wherein have we robbed thee? In tithes and offerings.","tokens":[{"text":"Will a"},{"text":"man","strongs":["H0120"]},{"text":"rob","strongs":["H6906"]},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"? Yet ye have"},{"text":"robbed","strongs":["H6906"]},{"text":"me. But ye"},{"text":"say","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", Wherein have we"},{"text":"robbed","strongs":["H6906"]},{"text":"thee? In"},{"text":"tithes","strongs":["H4643"]},{"text":"and"},{"text":"offerings","strongs":["H8641"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":9,"text":"Ye are cursed with a curse: for ye have robbed me, even this whole nation.","tokens":[{"text":"Ye are"},{"text":"cursed","strongs":["H0779"]},{"text":"with a"},{"text":"curse","strongs":["H3994"]},{"text":": for ye have"},{"text":"robbed","strongs":["H6906"]},{"text":"me, even this whole"},{"text":"nation","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":10,"text":"Bring ye all the tithes into the storehouse, that there may be meat in mine house, and prove me now herewith, saith the LORD of hosts, if I will not open you the windows of heaven, and pour you out a blessing, that there shall not be room enough to receive it.","tokens":[{"text":"Bring","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"ye all the"},{"text":"tithes","strongs":["H4643"]},{"text":"into the"},{"text":"storehouse","strongs":["H0214"]},{"text":", that there may be"},{"text":"meat","strongs":["H2964"]},{"text":"in mine"},{"text":"house","strongs":["H1004"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"prove","strongs":["H0974"]},{"text":"me now"},{"text":"herewith","strongs":["H2063"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":", if I will not"},{"text":"open","strongs":["H6605"]},{"text":"you the"},{"text":"windows","strongs":["H0699"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"heaven","strongs":["H8064"]},{"text":", and pour you"},{"text":"out","strongs":["H7324"]},{"text":"a"},{"text":"blessing","strongs":["H1293"]},{"text":", that there shall not be room"},{"text":"enough","strongs":["H1767"]},{"text":"to receive it."}]},{"number":11,"text":"And I will rebuke the devourer for your sakes, and he shall not destroy the fruits of your ground; neither shall your vine cast her fruit before the time in the field, saith the LORD of hosts.","tokens":[{"text":"And I will"},{"text":"rebuke","strongs":["H1605"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"devourer","strongs":["H0398"]},{"text":"for your sakes, and he shall not"},{"text":"destroy","strongs":["H7843"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"fruits","strongs":["H6529"]},{"text":"of your"},{"text":"ground","strongs":["H0127"]},{"text":"; neither shall your"},{"text":"vine","strongs":["H1612"]},{"text":"cast her"},{"text":"fruit","strongs":["H7921"]},{"text":"before the time in the"},{"text":"field","strongs":["H7704"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":12,"text":"And all nations shall call you blessed: for ye shall be a delightsome land, saith the LORD of hosts.","tokens":[{"text":"And all"},{"text":"nations","strongs":["H1471"]},{"text":"shall call you"},{"text":"blessed","strongs":["H0833"]},{"text":": for ye shall be a"},{"text":"delightsome","strongs":["H2656"]},{"text":"land","strongs":["H0776"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":13,"text":"Your words have been stout against me, saith the LORD. Yet ye say, What have we spoken so much against thee?","tokens":[{"text":"Your"},{"text":"words","strongs":["H1697"]},{"text":"have been"},{"text":"stout","strongs":["H2388"]},{"text":"against me,"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":". Yet ye"},{"text":"say","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", What have we"},{"text":"spoken","strongs":["H1696"]},{"text":"so much against thee?"}]},{"number":14,"text":"Ye have said, It is vain to serve God: and what profit is it that we have kept his ordinance, and that we have walked mournfully before the LORD of hosts?","tokens":[{"text":"Ye have"},{"text":"said","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":", It is"},{"text":"vain","strongs":["H7723"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"serve","strongs":["H5647"]},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":": and what"},{"text":"profit","strongs":["H1215"]},{"text":"is it that we have"},{"text":"kept","strongs":["H8104"]},{"text":"his"},{"text":"ordinance","strongs":["H4931"]},{"text":", and that we have"},{"text":"walked","strongs":["H1980"]},{"text":"mournfully","strongs":["H6941"]},{"text":"before","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":"?"}]},{"number":15,"text":"And now we call the proud happy; yea, they that work wickedness are set up; yea, they that tempt God are even delivered.","tokens":[{"text":"And now we"},{"text":"call","strongs":["H0833"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"proud","strongs":["H2086"]},{"text":"happy","strongs":["H0833"]},{"text":"; yea, they that"},{"text":"work","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"wickedness","strongs":["H7564"]},{"text":"are set"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H1129"]},{"text":"; yea, they that"},{"text":"tempt","strongs":["H0974"]},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"are even"},{"text":"delivered","strongs":["H4422"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":16,"text":"Then they that feared the LORD spake often one to another: and the LORD hearkened, and heard it, and a book of remembrance was written before him for them that feared the LORD, and that thought upon his name.","tokens":[{"text":"Then they that"},{"text":"feared","strongs":["H3373"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"spake"},{"text":"often","strongs":["H1696"]},{"text":"one","strongs":["H0376"]},{"text":"to"},{"text":"another","strongs":["H7453"]},{"text":": and the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"hearkened","strongs":["H7181"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"heard","strongs":["H8085"]},{"text":"it, and a"},{"text":"book","strongs":["H5612"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"remembrance","strongs":["H2146"]},{"text":"was"},{"text":"written","strongs":["H3789"]},{"text":"before","strongs":["H6440"]},{"text":"him for them that"},{"text":"feared","strongs":["H3373"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":", and that"},{"text":"thought","strongs":["H2803"]},{"text":"upon his"},{"text":"name","strongs":["H8034"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":17,"text":"And they shall be mine, saith the LORD of hosts, in that day when I make up my jewels; and I will spare them, as a man spareth his own son that serveth him.","tokens":[{"text":"And they shall be mine,"},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of"},{"text":"hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":", in that"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"when I make"},{"text":"up","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"my"},{"text":"jewels","strongs":["H5459"]},{"text":"; and I will"},{"text":"spare","strongs":["H2550"]},{"text":"them, as a"},{"text":"man","strongs":["H0376"]},{"text":"spareth","strongs":["H2550"]},{"text":"his own"},{"text":"son","strongs":["H1121"]},{"text":"that"},{"text":"serveth","strongs":["H5647"]},{"text":"him."}]},{"number":18,"text":"Then shall ye return, and discern between the righteous and the wicked, between him that serveth God and him that serveth him not.","tokens":[{"text":"Then shall ye"},{"text":"return","strongs":["H7725"]},{"text":", and"},{"text":"discern","strongs":["H7200"]},{"text":"between the"},{"text":"righteous","strongs":["H6662"]},{"text":"and the"},{"text":"wicked","strongs":["H7563"]},{"text":", between him that"},{"text":"serveth","strongs":["H5647"]},{"text":"God","strongs":["H0430"]},{"text":"and him that"},{"text":"serveth","strongs":["H5647"]},{"text":"him not."}]}]},"4":{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"For, behold, the day cometh, that shall burn as an oven; and all the proud, yea, and all that do wickedly, shall be stubble: and the day that cometh shall burn them up, saith the LORD of hosts, that it shall leave them neither root nor branch.","tokens":[{"text":"For, behold, the"},{"text":"day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"cometh","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":", that shall"},{"text":"burn","strongs":["H1197"]},{"text":"as an oven","strongs":["H8574"]},{"text":";"},{"text":"and all the proud","strongs":["H2086"]},{"text":", yea, and all that"},{"text":"do","strongs":["H6213"]},{"text":"wickedly","strongs":["H7564"]},{"text":","},{"text":"shall be stubble","strongs":["H7179"]},{"text":":"},{"text":"and the day","strongs":["H3117"]},{"text":"that"},{"text":"cometh","strongs":["H0935"]},{"text":"shall burn them up","strongs":["H3857"]},{"text":","},{"text":"saith","strongs":["H0559"]},{"text":"the"},{"text":"LORD","strongs":["H3068"]},{"text":"of hosts","strongs":["H6635"]},{"text":","},{"text":"that it shall leave","strongs":["H5800"]},{"text":"them neither root","strongs":["H8328"]},{"text":"nor branch","strongs":["H6057"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":2,"text":"But unto you that fear my name shall the Sun of righteousness arise with healing in his wings; and ye shall go forth, and grow up as calves of the stall.","tokens":[{"text":"But unto you that fear","strongs":["H3373"]},{"text":"my name","strongs":["H8034"]},{"text":"shall the Sun","strongs":["H8121"]},{"text":"of righteousness","strongs":["H6666"]},{"text":"arise","strongs":["H2224"]},{"text":"with healing","strongs":["H4832"]},{"text":"in his wings","strongs":["H3671"]},{"text":";"},{"text":"and ye shall go forth","strongs":["H3318"]},{"text":","},{"text":"and grow up","strongs":["H6335"]},{"text":"as calves","strongs":["H5695"]},{"text":"of the stall","strongs":["H4770"]},{"text":"."}]},{"number":3,"text":"And ye shall tread down the wicked; for they shall be ashes under the soles of your feet in the day that I shall do this, saith the LORD of hosts.","tokens":[{"text":"And ye shall tread down","strongs":["H6072"]},{"text":"the wicked","strongs":["H